<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy" description="Cookie Policy for FC Mobile Tools by TanzimFC.">
  <article class="wrap legal-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">LEGAL</p>
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-lead">Last updated: September 12, 2026</p>
    <section><h2>What are cookies?</h2><p>Cookies are small pieces of data stored by websites or third-party services in your browser. They can help a site remember settings or help operators understand how a website is used.</p></section>
    <section><h2>How FC Mobile Tools uses them</h2><p>FC Mobile Tools may use cookies or similar technologies through Google Analytics and other third-party services used by the site. Analytics helps us understand general traffic and improve our tools and content.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Local browser storage</h2><p>Some tools may use browser local storage rather than cookies to keep preferences, progress, or temporary tool data on your device. This information can normally be cleared through your browser settings.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Managing cookies</h2><p>You can block or delete cookies through your browser settings. If you block certain technologies, some analytics or third-party functionality may not work as intended.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Third-party cookies</h2><p>External services linked or embedded by the website may use their own cookies. Their use is governed by the policies of those services, not by this Cookie Policy.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Changes</h2><p>This policy may be updated when our services or third-party integrations change.</p></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
